   <narrative xml:lang="EN">2024 Midt Term Review - Rwanga</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Midt term review: Rwanga - Empowering sustainable livelihoods &#x2013; Enhancing the reintegration of returnees for long-term prosperity in Iraq 2023-2026&quot;-project. The overall objective of the project is to facilitate the sustainable reintegration of Iraqi returnees into their communities of return by enabling a supportive environment for their successful and long-term integration in the Kurdish Region of Iraq. This approach will contribute to the reintegration programmes that address the specific needs of Kurdish Iraqi returnees.</narrative>
  </description>
